"""
aq-durable-sweeper: Proactive autonomous intelligence sweeper & signal classifier.
Inspired by IndyDevDan's durable agent architecture (pi-durable-news-agent).
Maintains durable state across restarts and sweeps for SOTA software factory signals
across 5 core engineering disciplines:
1. Agentic Factory & Multi-Agent Architecture
2. Declarative Systems, OS & Microarchitectural Confinement
3. High-Quality Frontend Design, Cockpit & Ergonomics
4. Quantitative, Stochastic & Signal Analytics
5. Reliability, Testing & Formal Verification
"""
